<main class="erp-page"><nav class="erp-breadcrumb"><a href="/erp/pending">Pendências</a><span>/</span><span><?= $this->e((string)$task['condominium_name']) ?></span></nav>
<?php $this->insert('components/erp-page-header',['heading'=>(string)$task['title'],'description'=>'Pendência automática de origem ERP. Ela será resolvida quando um CNPJ válido for salvo.','kicker'=>'ERP · PENDÊNCIA']); ?>
<section class="erp-panel erp-detail-section"><h2>Condomínio relacionado</h2><?php if($canViewCondominium): ?><p><a class="erp-record-link" href="/erp/condominiums/<?= (int)$task['condominium_id'] ?>"><?= $this->e((string)$task['condominium_name']) ?></a></p><?php else: ?><p><?= $this->e((string)$task['condominium_name']) ?> · você não possui acesso de leitura ao cadastro.</p><?php endif; ?><?php if($canEditCondominium): ?><a class="erp-button erp-button-primary" href="/erp/condominiums/<?= (int)$task['condominium_id'] ?>/edit">Editar cadastro</a><?php elseif($canViewCondominium): ?><p>Seu acesso permite acompanhar esta pendência, mas não editar o cadastro. Encaminhe a atualização a um usuário com permissão de escrita.</p><?php endif; ?><p>Status: <strong><?= $completed?'Resolvida':($task['status']==='in_progress'?'Em andamento':'Pendente') ?></strong> · Criada em <?= $this->e(date('d/m/Y',strtotime((string)$task['created_at']))) ?><?= $task['completed_at']?' · Resolvida em '.$this->e(date('d/m/Y',strtotime((string)$task['completed_at']))):'' ?></p></section>
<?php if(!$completed): ?><form method="post" action="/erp/pending/<?= (int)$task['id'] ?>" class="erp-panel erp-form-panel"><?= $this->csrf() ?><section class="erp-form-section"><h2>Acompanhamento operacional</h2><p>O prazo abaixo é interno e configurável; não representa prazo legal.</p><div class="erp-form-grid"><label>Responsável<select name="assigned_user_id"><option value="">Sem responsável</option><?php foreach($assignees as $person): ?><option value="<?= (int)$person['id'] ?>" <?= (int)($task['assigned_user_id']??0)===(int)$person['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?= $this->e((string)$person['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="pending" <?= $task['status']==='pending'?'selected':'' ?>>Pendente</option><option value="in_progress" <?= $task['status']==='in_progress'?'selected':'' ?>>Em andamento</option></select></label><label>Prioridade<select name="priority"><?php foreach(['low'=>'Baixa','normal'=>'Normal','high'=>'Alta','urgent'=>'Urgente'] as $key=>$label): ?><option value="<?= $key ?>" <?= $task['priority']===$key?'selected':'' ?>><?= $label ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Prazo interno<input type="date" name="due_date" value="<?= $this->e($task['due_at']?date('Y-m-d',strtotime((string)$task['due_at'])):'') ?>"></label><label class="wide">Contexto<textarea name="description" rows="4" maxlength="5000"><?= $this->e((string)($task['description']??'')) ?></textarea></label></div></section><footer class="erp-form-actions"><a class="erp-button" href="/erp/pending">Voltar</a><button class="erp-button erp-button-primary" type="submit">Salvar acompanhamento</button></footer></form><?php endif; ?>
<section class="erp-panel erp-detail-section"><header class="erp-panel-head"><div><h2>Histórico</h2><p>Eventos da condição operacional e do acompanhamento.</p></div></header><?php if($history===[]): ?><p>Nenhum evento de auditoria registrado.</p><?php else: ?><ol><?php foreach($history as $event): ?><li><?= $this->e(str_replace('erp.pending.','', (string)$event['event_type'])) ?> · <?= $this->e((string)($event['actor_name']??'Sistema')) ?> · <?= $this->e(date('d/m/Y H:i',strtotime((string)$event['created_at']))) ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ol><?php endif; ?></section></main>
